the pieces came together.

306
00:25:57.020 --> 00:26:00.580
But even Orochi didn't think
you would team up with pirates.

307
00:26:00.580 --> 00:26:00.650
It seems they were
among the so-called

308
00:26:00.650 --> 00:26:02.540
It seems they were among
the so-called "ghosts"

309
00:26:02.540 --> 00:26:03.110
"ghosts" appearing
at Oden Castle.

310
00:26:03.110 --> 00:26:05.250
appearing at Oden Castle.

311
00:26:05.250 --> 00:26:09.070
Reports from Punk Hazard,
the battle in Dressrosa,

312
00:26:09.070 --> 00:26:11.660
