313
00:26:11.660 --> 00:26:16.290
All threads that were
tied together by the Straw Hats.

314
00:26:16.290 --> 00:26:16.350
Huh. Funny how it
all worked out.

315
00:26:16.350 --> 00:26:18.730
Huh. Funny how
it all worked out.

316
00:26:18.730 --> 00:26:18.870
I've been eyeing Straw Hat
for some time,

317
00:26:18.870 --> 00:26:20.940
I've been eyeing
Straw Hat for some time,

318
00:26:20.940 --> 00:26:24.820
