an impressive army.

322
00:26:33.680 --> 00:26:37.990
But watch out, 'cause pirates
will stab you in the back.

323
00:26:39.600 --> 00:26:42.400
The second Straw Hat
realizes you're gonna lose,

324
00:26:42.400 --> 00:26:44.560
